{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17525","headline":"湖南观察使故相国袁公挽歌二首 一 · 权德舆","name":"湖南观察使故相国袁公挽歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五驱龙虎节，一入凤皇池。\n令尹自无喜，羊公人不疑。\n天归京兆日，叶下洞庭时。\n湘水秋风至，凄凉吹素旗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}